{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15222050","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15222050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1522205001:0":{"text":"Anyone lays a hand on anyone else and I swear, you'll answer to the army!","source_cn":"谁敢动手？！真当军队都是摆设吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A86B303D1691747","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1522205002:0":{"text":"The relief food is for <style=\"highlight\">every Halian</style>. Rich or poor. That's the law!","source_cn":"呼临城的赈灾粮，自然<style=highlight>...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BCB9ED3E6EE41F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1522205003:0":{"text":"Keep making trouble, and I'll have you locked up!","source_cn":"要是谁再闹事，就等着被我关进牢里去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA041A46751A393F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1522205004:1":{"text":"That food is saving lives! You can't do this!","source_cn":"——那些是救命的粮食！你怎么能这么做？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3943597FC2139A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1522205005:0":{"text":"Move it, move it! Didn't you hear the lieutenant?!","source_cn":"去去去！没听到副将大人都发话了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x868640084EFAEAC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1522205006:0":{"text":"You want to keep shouting? Then you can shout from a jail cell!","source_cn":"你要是再闹事，就等着被投牢吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C99188397E6ADA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1522205007:0":{"text":"Haha... Didn't think I'd see something this funny today.","source_cn":"哈哈……没想到还有这么好笑的事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB260A5978D7C272F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1522205008:0":{"text":"Tell me, did you let Perseus in on your little scheme? Or are you planning to <style=\"highlight\">rob the relief food</style> behind his back?","source_cn":"我很好奇，你们商量好的事告诉珀尔修斯了吗？他知道你们<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CBB2B59D8108C47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1522205009:0":{"text":"You... what are you implying?! W-watch your mouth!","source_cn":"你……你这话几个意思？！我、我警告你，不要血口喷人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7880DD33040840AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1522205010:1":{"text":"He's not wrong. Perseus will hear about this. And he will punish you.","source_cn":"他没有说错。珀尔修斯会惩罚你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DBD57C926995BB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1522205011:0":{"text":"Shut it, beast!","source_cn":"闭嘴，你这野兽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x646E90A0E3DD95F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1522205011":{"text":"Shut it, beast!","source_cn":"闭嘴，你这野兽！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x646E90A0E3DD95F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1522205014:0":{"text":"Lieutenant Lygos, drought might be eased by a lucky rainstorm, but famine like won't be fixed overnight.","source_cn":"隆尔副将，干旱尚可盼望一场大雨缓解，但呼临城的饥荒绝非...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D2EA08E6678BF8F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1522205015:0":{"text":"With limited food reserves, it's my view that <style=\"highlight\">priority should be given to those suffering the worst</style>. It's the fastest way to save lives.","source_cn":"在存粮有限的境况下，以我拙见，<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE874FD99CCE4024","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1522205016:0":{"text":"Wouldn't you agree?","source_cn":"你认为呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F2889209D717D19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1522205017:0":{"text":"Halia's problems aren't your concern.","source_cn":"……这是呼临城的事，不用你费心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11D4A5FCCC20DC32","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1522205018:0":{"text":"Kalan, give the food to the starving. People like Jakon don't get a crumb.","source_cn":"卡利安，把粮食分给那些饥民，不许伊阿宋这样的家伙领。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0C21704B6CB5479","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1522205019:0":{"text":"Huh?! But sir—","source_cn":"啊？！可是副将大人——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2B4C534FC3CAC9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1522205020:1":{"text":"Shut it! Get lost!","source_cn":"闭嘴！滚到一边去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CA7315743B86776","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1522205021:0":{"text":"And you! Why are you standing around? Start handing o